  hsteps (HB [47892099; 24915618; 1835911; 568849; 317482; 29175; 9907; 6375; 799; 475; 93; 58; 5] 11506557 1 3 (repeat (1, 2) 135985238 ++ w) 1)
         (HB [47892099; 24915618; 1835911; 568849; 317482; 29175; 9907; 6375; 799; 475; 93; 58; 5] 147491795 1 271970479 (w) 1).
Proof.
  intro w.
  rewrite S61rap1.
  rewrite S61rap2.
  (* step 1153: M pop12 (135985238,) *)
  apply (pop12 135985238 [47892099; 24915618; 1835911; 568849; 317482; 29175; 9907; 6375; 799; 475; 93; 58; 5] 11506557 3 (w) 1); exact S61rap3.
Qed.

